Need title lighting. Add after drawPlayer before restore? `drawLighting` uses this.ctx set wctx? In drawTitle called with ctx=this.ctx main. We can call after drawPlayer and before restore. Need build object. But drawLighting's `def.props` etc. Let's add:
```
this.drawLighting({
 room:def, cam, time:t,
 player:dummy, items:[], bosses:{}, taken:new Set(), boss:null
});
```
But dummy has x/y etc. `drawLighting` checks p. yes. Also `game.updraftActive` undefined. fine. It will lay darkness on title scene. Currently no lighting so room brighter but flat. Add should give moody with bench lamp. CSS radial overlays anyway.

Then add glow from lamp via drawLighting. Let's patch.

